  name: agentGenerated_Monthly Sales Performance KPI Dashboard
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 2c06b7a1-4c4b-444e-a1fc-9e57ddcfaa78
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • November 2024 achieved peak sales of 118,447.83, highest in 48-month period
        • Q4 months consistently outperform other quarters across all years
        • General upward sales trend from January 2021 through December 2024
        • December 2023 second-highest at 96,999.04

        Recommendations:
        • Leverage Q4 seasonal patterns by increasing inventory and marketing spend in October-December
        • Analyze November 2024 success factors to replicate in other high-performing months
